# Stray `go build ./cmd/server` artifact in a service root. The release path
# builds this service to /out/opl-gateway-integration (see Dockerfile), so a
# binary at this exact path is never a build input. Anchored to the repository
# root so it cannot match services/gateway-integration/cmd/server/.
/services/gateway-integration/server
